27. The Most Important Cheat Sheet

| Problem pattern         | Key state/idea                       |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| Two Sum                 | HashMap of seen values               |
| Duplicate detection     | HashSet                              |
| Sliding Window          | left/right + maintained window state |
| Range Sum               | Prefix Sum                           |
| Count subarrays sum K   | Prefix Sum + frequency map           |
| Longest subarray        | Prefix Sum + earliest index          |
| Binary Search           | Monotonic ordered search space       |
| Binary Search on Answer | Monotonic feasibility                |
| Next Greater            | Monotonic decreasing stack           |
| Next Smaller            | Monotonic increasing stack           |
| Largest Rectangle       | Increasing stack + boundaries        |
| Subsets I               | Include / exclude                    |
| Subsets II              | Sort + skip duplicate siblings       |
| Permutations            | Choose unused element + `used[]`     |
| Combination Sum         | Reuse allowed → recurse with `i`     |
| Combination Sum II      | No reuse → recurse with `i+1`        |
